      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model Links\n[\ud83e\udd17 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) - wired into `model` (required)\n- the fl2va checkpoint - wired into `model_fl2va` (optional, only needed for Hybrid Continuation or First/Last Frame mode) - **TODO: confirm exact filename before relying on this note**\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n\ud83d\udcc2 ComfyUI/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 models/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 vae/\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 diffusion_models/\n\u2502   \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n\u2502   \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 (your fl2va checkpoint, if using Hybrid Continuation / First-Last Frame)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 \ud83d\udcc2 text_encoders/\n\u2502       \u2514\u2500\u2500 qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models.\n\n- Issues with **Muse Minimax Director** itself (the timeline UI, chunking, compiled prompt): [MiniMaxH3-Director/issues](https://github.com/muse-collective-26/MiniMaxH3-Director/issues)\n- Cannot run / runtime errors in ComfyUI core or the stock MiniMax H3 nodes: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 170,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -759.5656628702811,
        5829.57983839641
      ],
      "size": [
        695.3067868770345,
        731.7819474033731
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "MiniMax Director",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Muse Minimax Director\n\n## Mode\n- **Reference (Omni)** \u2014 multi-character/video/audio references, soft-followed\n- **First/Last Frame** \u2014 Ref 1 = first frame, Ref 2 = last frame, locked exactly\n\n## Generation\n- **Total Duration** \u2014 the finished length\n- **Chunk Size** \u2014 length of each single MiniMax call (auto-splits above ~15s)\n\n## Resolution\n- **Aspect Ratio / Megapixels** \u2014 output size\n- **Multiple Of** \u2014 leave alone unless you know why you're changing it\n\n## Sampling\n- Standard sampler controls\n- **Shift (video) / Shift (audio)** \u2014 advanced, leave at default\n\n## Reference Settings\n- **Ref Image Size** \u2014 \"match\" is faster, \"max\" is stronger identity but slower\n- **Dialogue Language** \u2014 feeds every spoken line\n- **Hybrid Continuation** \u2014 multi-chunk only, needs a First/Last-Frame model wired in\n\n## Overall Style\nOne or two sentences setting the look of the whole clip \u2014 lighting, palette, camera feel.\n\n## Soundscape & Music\n- **Overall Soundscape** \u2014 ambience/physical sound\n- **Non-Diegetic Music** \u2014 background score only the audience hears\n- Blank or `N/A` if not needed\n\n## Characters / Location\n- Drop an image into **Ref 1\u20139** for each character, **Location** for the setting\n- Type a description or click **Analyze**\n- **Retention** \u2014 how strictly it's followed; leave on `fully preserved` unless intentionally blending\n\n## Ref Video\n*(optional)*\n- **Subject description** \u2014 blank = pure motion/camera reference; fill in if a person/thing should be reused\n- **Role** \u2014 Reference / Editing source / Continuation source\n- **Include this clip's audio** \u2014 also pulls its sound in as a voice reference\n\n## Ref Audio\n*(optional)*\n- A short voice sample + whose voice it is\n- **Retention** \u2014 `reference` clones the voice/style; `fully copy` reuses the actual audio\n\n## Timeline / CUTs\n- One CUT per beat \u2014 drag block edges to change pacing\n- Put `\"quoted text\"` in a CUT for dialogue \u2014 a **Speaker** dropdown appears\n\n## Referring to things in CUT text"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
