mming machinery and pipes. <Subject 2> (S2) says, <d>[English] This must be it,.</d> and they step through into it.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nLow ambient ship hum and a faint electronic pulse continue throughout the corridor\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA subtle synth pulse underscoring the scene, low and steady."
